#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understanding high availability and disaster recovery for Qiskit Runtime "
"{#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Pag-unawa sa high availability at disaster recovery para sa Qiskit Runtime "
"{#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"High availability (HA) is the ability for a service to remain operational "
"and accessible in the presence of unexpected failures. Disaster recovery is "
"the process of recovering the service instance to a working state. Qiskit "
"Runtime customers are not responsible for disaster recovery planning or "
"actions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang high availability (HA) ay ang kakayahan ng isang serbisyo na manatiling "
"gumagana at naa-access kahit may mga hindi inaasahang pagpalya. Ang disaster"
" recovery naman ay ang proseso ng pagbabalik ng service instance sa isang "
"gumaganang estado. Ang mga customer ng Qiskit Runtime ay hindi responsable "
"sa pagpaplano o pagkilos para sa disaster recovery.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime is a regional service that fulfills the defined [Service "
"Level Objectives "
"(SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) with any "
"paid plan. For more information, see the [Service Level Agreement "
"(SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) "
"for IBM Cloud&reg;. For more information about the available IBM Cloud "
"regions and data centers for Qiskit Runtime, see [Service and infrastructure"
" availability by "
"location](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-"
"services_region).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit Runtime ay isang regional na serbisyo na tumutupad sa mga tinukoy"
" na [Service Level Objectives "
"(SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) sa "
"anumang bayad na plano. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang "
"[Service Level Agreement "
"(SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) "
"para sa IBM Cloud&reg;. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa mga "
"available na IBM Cloud region at data center para sa Qiskit Runtime, tingnan"
" ang [Service and infrastructure availability by "
"location.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-"
"services_region)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "High availability architecture {#high-availability-architecture}"
msgstr "Arkitektura ng high availability {#high-availability-architecture}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "High availability features {#high-availability-features}"
msgstr "Mga tampok ng high availability {#high-availability-features}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This service is provisioned across three zones in a multi-zone region with "
"no single point of failure. API requests are routed through a load balancer "
"to the HA instance nodes, each in a different zone.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang serbisyong ito ay ini-provision sa tatlong zone sa isang multi-zone "
"region na walang single point of failure. Ang mga API request ay ini-route "
"sa pamamagitan ng load balancer papunta sa mga HA instance node, na bawat "
"isa ay nasa iba't ibang zone.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an HA instance node or zone fails, the service continues to run API "
"requests through to the surviving HA instance nodes.  No noticeable "
"degradation of service occurs during a zonal failure.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung mabigo ang isang HA instance node o zone, patuloy pa ring ipinapadaan "
"ng serbisyo ang mga API request sa mga natitirang HA instance node. Walang "
"kapansin-pansing pagbaba ng kalidad ng serbisyo ang nagaganap sa panahon ng "
"zonal failure.\n"

